and there is no reversed nun. A mark is recorded on the verse it FOLLOWS.

- pe (22): MT 1:21, 2:13, 2:16, 2:28, 2:45, 2:49, 3:23, 3:30, 4:25, 4:34, 5:12, 5:16, 5:30, 6:29, 7:14, 7:28, 8:27, 9:27, 10:3, 10:21, 12:3, 12:8
